//! Web/TUI **wire contracts** — the provider-neutral DTOs the SPA and the
//! inspection plane consume over HTTP/WS.
//!
//! ts-rs is the source of truth: every type here derives [`ts_rs::TS`] with
//! `#[ts(export)]`, and the regenerated TypeScript is committed under
//! `contracts/generated/`. The drift test in `tests/contract_drift.rs`
//! re-exports into a clean temp dir and asserts byte-identity with the
//! committed files, so the "generated by ts-rs" header is genuinely true.
//!
//! Inline helper DTOs ([`entity::EntityHandle`], [`action::AvailableAction`])
//! are real Rust source types emitted inline via `#[ts(type = …)]` overrides;
//! they have no standalone binding but still trace every contract field to a
//! concrete Rust type.

pub mod action;
pub mod entity;
pub mod pulls;
pub mod repository;
pub mod review;
pub mod settings;
pub mod source;
pub mod web;

